  "details": "At the moment, all type (Open/Request to Join/Invite-Only) of Group counted as public instance.\n\nThis is confusing people that server has issue than group instance.\n\nExpected behaviour be\n\nGroup Open: Show instance with name of group and shown public instance\n\nGroup Request: Show group name and count as private instance until join to group\n\nGroup Invite: Not show at all and count as private instance\n\nIf behaviour not change at this stage yet, just count as private instance be much nicer.\n\nIt is kind of sad cannot join to public instance for chill or gaming really.",
